{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/7f606d9ad8c92a2b9ed5b9da10c939b6.poster.avif?t=1771348693\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/7f606d9ad8c92a2b9ed5b9da10c939b6.webm?t=1771348693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/7f606d9ad8c92a2b9ed5b9da10c939b6.mp4?t=1771348693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Bomber</strong> is an intense and thrilling 2D vertical scrolling action game that blends <strong>roguelike elements</strong> with <strong>bullet-hell dodging gameplay</strong>. In this game, you'll control a tiny bomber, constantly moving forward, dodging dense bullets, and bombing enemies, all while honing your skills and reaction time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique feature of the game is its <strong>countdown system</strong>: each run has a fixed countdown timer, and players must collect coins scattered across the map to extend their remaining time. Additionally, successfully dodging bullets triggers a <strong>boost</strong> that accelerates the scrolling, offering a fast-paced, exhilarating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Bomber</strong> features <strong>charming pixel art</strong> in a cute, cartoony style, complemented by <strong>retro 8-bit music</strong>, delivering a nostalgic yet challenging gaming experience. Each run offers the opportunity for players to enhance their bomber through <strong>random upgrades</strong> and <strong>growth elements</strong>, strengthening their abilities and creating new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge is a fresh adventure as you aim to continually improve your longest distance, ultimately facing the <strong>final boss</strong> after reaching a certain distance, proving yourself as the true victor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy the constant progress of <strong>roguelike games</strong> or the intense thrill of <strong>bullet-hell dodging</strong>, <strong>Tiny Bomber</strong> offers endless fun and excitement. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/ab9398e1aa7a80b16860bc3c65a2d808.poster.avif?t=1771348693\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/ab9398e1aa7a80b16860bc3c65a2d808.webm?t=1771348693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/extras/ab9398e1aa7a80b16860bc3c65a2d808.mp4?t=1771348693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464710?t=1771348693","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3464710?t=1771348693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/3fbb840e77efad3951754eaa9fd72376102f6809/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771348693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464710/3fbb840e77efad3951754eaa9fd72376102f6809/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771348693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"des